<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <title>Emanate - Page 4 & 5</title>

  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/icon?family=Material+Icons">

  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .modules {
      background-color: #14162b;
      color: white;
      padding: 60px 40px;
    }

    .modules-row {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 40px;
    }

    .modules-row .item {
      flex: 1;
      min-width: 220px;
    }

    .modules-row .material-icons {
      background-color: #4a4dff;
      padding: 10px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .modules-row h3 {
      margin-top: 15px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .modules-row p {
      color: #bbbbcc;
    }

    .fast-banner {
      background-color: #6a6ff0;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 80px 20px;
    }

    .fast-banner h2 {
      font-size: 34px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .pricing {
      background-color: #14162b;
      color: white;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 70px 20px;
    }

    .pricing h2 {
      font-size: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .pricing > p {
      color: #bbbbcc;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
    }

    .plans {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 25px;
    }

    .plan-box {
      background-color: #1c1e3a;
      text-align: left;
      padding: 30px;
      border-radius: 8px;
      width: 240px;
    }

    .plan-box h3 {
      margin-bottom: 10px;
    }

    .plan-box .price {
      font-size: 30px;
      margin-bottom: 15px;
    }

    .plan-box p {
      color: #bbbbcc;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .plan-box button {
      width: 100%;
      background-color: #33355a;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      padding: 12px;
      border-radius: 6px;
      font-size: 15px;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>

  <div class="modules">
    <div class="modules-row">

      <div class="item">
        <span class="material-icons">brightness_3</span>
        <h3>x2 Modules</h3>
        <p>Each module can easily be turned into a dark version by adding .dark as class.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="material-icons">account_circle</span>
        <h3>Onboarding Screens</h3>
        <p>Additional pages to log in, sign up as well as forgot password are included.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="item">
        <span class="material-icons">tune</span>
        <h3>Unlimited Possibilities</h3>
        <p>With a custom framework and global classes, build consistent pages with ease.</p>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="fast-banner">
    <h2>And... fast. Really fast.</h2>
    <p>The main focus of this template is performance, no bloat.</p>
  </div>


  <div class="pricing">
    <h2>Or find the perfect paid plan for your business.</h2>
    <p>Thousands of people rely on our service.</p>

    <div class="plans">

      <div class="plan-box">
        <h3>For Professionals</h3>
        <div class="price">$10 /mo</div>
        <p>Ut enim ad minima veniam, quis nostrum exercitationem.</p>
        <button>Purchase</button>
      </div>

      <div class="plan-box">
        <h3>For Teams</h3>
        <div class="price">$20 /mo</div>
        <p>Ut enim ad minima veniam, quis nostrum exercitationem.</p>
        <button>Purchase</button>
      </div>

      <div class="plan-box">
        <h3>For Enterprises</h3>
        <div class="price">$50 /mo</div>
        <p>Ut enim ad minima veniam, quis nostrum exercitationem.</p>
        <button>Purchase</button>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>

</body>
</html>
